    "The manufacturing issues will also impact the planned NVL576 system, which connects 8x Oberon racks over CPO between the NVSwitches, meaning that the system will also likely be delayed or limited to small volumes, the firm noted.",
    "In response to a request for comment from DCD regarding the Kyber claims, a spokesperson for Nvidia said: \"Our roadmap is intact.\"",
    "The news comes a week after SemiAnalysis separately reported that Nvidia had canceled the four-die Rubin Ultra design in favor of the two-chiplet design, also due to “manufacturing execution concerns.”"
